![high](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/high-priority.svg)

Ensure that `visualReceiptEvidence` is robust against cases where `context.receipt.item` is undefined/null to prevent potential `TypeError`s during dereferencing.

```suggestion
function visualReceiptEvidence(context, supportsFields) {
  if (!context.receipt?.item) return null;
  return evidenceRef({
    evidenceRefId: refId(
      'evidence:source_visual_receipt',
      context.receipt.item.source_visual_receipt_id,
    ),
    sourceFamily: 'source_visual_receipt',
    artifactPath: context.paths.sourceVisualReceiptsIn,
    pointer: `/receipts/${context.receipt.index}`,
    supportsFields,
  });
}
```

